          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 7866,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1078925653,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "No, `bin` is correct because that is where the Windows DLLs are found. For some reason the Windows job did not run for this MR.\n\nI don't think PATH_SUFFIXES is fixing anything here. What is your system?",
