        {
          "id": 1078946319,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Result from the Windows build job:\n```\n-- The following OPTIONAL packages have not been found:\n * WrapVulkanHeaders\n * Qt6Multimedia\n * GNUTLS (required version >= 3.5.8)\n * DOXYGEN\n * Asciidoctor (required version >= 1.5)\n * XSLTPROC\n-- Configuring done\n```\n\nI know Linux .so files are found in `lib`, and it works fine. Like I said `GNUTLS_HINTS` is Windows specific.",
